      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>LaSalle College does not offer on-campus housing or dormitories. If students need help in finding suitable living arrangements, the college's Student Services team can provide students with resources and assistance. The college can offer rental listings, tips on navigating the rental market, and guidance on leases and tenancy agreements. Students are even provided with a private Facebook group so they can connect with each other in order to find potential roommates.</p><p>Many international students choose to live in homestay options. This is where a trusted local family provides meals and accommodation to students so they can improve their English skills and ingratiate within the local community. Popular neighbourhoods for students include Downtown Vancouver, Kitsilano, and Mount Pleasant.</p>",
